Package: SUNbeta12
Type: Package
Title: SUN Beta 1.2 Resolution Recommendation for Seurat SNN Clustering
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "SUN",
           family = "Team",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sun@example.com")
Description: Provides SUN beta 1.2 for automatic resolution recommendation
    in Seurat SNN graph clustering workflows. The package scans resolution
    intervals, applies plateau-cache aligned interval replacement, and returns
    a recommended resolution with corresponding cluster labels.
